%% id: agent-observation-action-state-loop
%% title: Agent 的观察动作状态循环
%% alt: Agent Runtime 在观察、决策、动作、转交、完成和失败状态之间受控转换
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> Decide
    Decide --> Act: 工具动作
    Act --> Observe: 结果/错误
    Decide --> Handoff: 转交
    Handoff --> Observe
    Decide --> Finish: 最终回答
    Decide --> Fail: 预算或策略拒绝
    Finish --> [*]
    Fail --> [*]
